      <h1 class="page-title post-title reveal">No Shortcuts to Court: The NICN Reinforces Mandatory ADR in Employment/Trade Disputes</h1>
      <p class="page-lede reveal">Parties to employment and trade disputes are often eager to head straight to court. Nigerian law generally takes a different view.</p>
      <p class="post-meta reveal"><time datetime="2026-08-16">16 August 2026</time></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="post-hero-media">
    <div class="container">
      <figure class="post-figure">
        <img src="https://resource.scp-law.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-14-at-10.04.02-AM.jpeg" alt="" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
